# Abandoned Air Temple: "{3}{W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control." On turn 3 Bot1 has a Plains
# and the Temple (untapped, for the Plains), four Moxen of which three and the Plains pay {3}{W} (the Temple taps
# itself as the cost), two Ornithopters (artifact creatures, one cast this turn and so summoning sick -- counters do not
# care) and a Sol Ring (an artifact that is not a creature). Each Ornithopter gets a counter. The Sol Ring, Bot1's
# Moxen, and Bot2's Llanowar Elves get none: the creatures must be ones you control.

